<div class="container py-5" style="max-width: 900px;">
  <div class="card shadow-sm">
    <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
      <h1 class="h3 mb-0">Privacy Policy</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body" style="max-height: 70vh; overflow-y: auto;">
      <p class="text-muted"><small>Last updated: January 14, 2026 | Version 1.0</small></p>

      <h2 class="h5 mt-4">1. Introduction</h2>
      <p>This Privacy Policy explains how AMOS Labs ("we", "us", or "our") collects, uses, and protects your personal information when you use our Service.</p>

      <h2 class="h5 mt-4">2. Information We Collect</h2>
      
      <h3 class="h6 mt-3">Account Information</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Name and email address</li>
        <li>Company/organization name</li>
        <li>Payment information (processed securely by Stripe)</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="h6 mt-3">Usage Data</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>How you interact with the Service</li>
        <li>Features and tools you use</li>
        <li>Performance and error data</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="h6 mt-3">Content You Provide</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Marketing content and campaigns</li>
        <li>Contact and lead information</li>
        <li>Business information and preferences</li>
        <li>Conversations with AI assistants</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="h5 mt-4">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use your information to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Provide and improve the Service</li>
        <li>Process payments and manage your account</li>
        <li>Send important service updates</li>
        <li>Train and improve our AI models (using anonymized data)</li>
        <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="h5 mt-4">4. AI and Machine Learning</h2>
      <p>Our Service uses AI to provide its features. Your content may be processed by AI models to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Generate marketing content and suggestions</li>
        <li>Analyze and optimize campaigns</li>
        <li>Provide intelligent assistance</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We use third-party AI providers (including AWS Bedrock and OpenRouter) to process requests. Your data is transmitted securely and processed according to our data processing agreements with these providers.</p>

      <h2 class="h5 mt-4">5. Data Sharing</h2>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share data with:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> Companies that help us operate the Service (hosting, payments, AI processing)</li>
        <li><strong>Integrations:</strong> Third-party services you connect to (with your authorization)</li>
        <li><strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> When required by law or to protect our rights</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="h5 mt-4">6. Data Security</h2>
      <p>We implement industry-standard security measures including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Encryption in transit (TLS) and at rest</li>
        <li>Secure authentication with optional two-factor authentication</li>
        <li>Regular security audits and monitoring</li>
        <li>Access controls and logging</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="h5 mt-4">7. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>We retain your data for as long as your account is active. After account deletion:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your personal data is deleted within 30 days</li>
        <li>Anonymized usage data may be retained for analytics</li>
        <li>Some data may be retained as required by law</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="h5 mt-4">8. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on your location, you may have rights to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access your personal data</li>
        <li>Correct inaccurate data</li>
        <li>Delete your data</li>
        <li>Export your data</li>
        <li>Object to certain processing</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@amoslabs.com">privacy@amoslabs.com</a>.</p>

      <h2 class="h5 mt-4">9. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
      <p>We use cookies and similar technologies for:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Authentication and session management</li>
        <li>Preferences and settings</li>
        <li>Analytics (to understand how the Service is used)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="h5 mt-4">10. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>The Service is not intended for children under 18. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

      <h2 class="h5 mt-4">11. International Transfers</h2>
      <p>Your data may be processed in countries outside your residence. We ensure appropriate safeguards are in place for international transfers.</p>

      <h2 class="h5 mt-4">12. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of material changes via email or through the Service.</p>

      <h2 class="h5 mt-4">13. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>For privacy-related questions or concerns:</p>
      <p>
        <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:privacy@amoslabs.com">privacy@amoslabs.com</a><br>
        <strong>Address:</strong> AMOS Labs, Inc.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-footer text-center">
      <%= link_to "Back to Login", new_user_session_path, class: "btn btn-outline-secondary" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

